            "category": "INSULIN RESISTANCE",
            "heading": "Fix Your Destroyed Insulin Sensitivity (The Real Reason Your Blood Sugar Refuses to Drop)",
            "body": "<p>Eating clean isn't enough when your body stops responding to insulin. Insulin resistance traps glucose in your bloodstream, driving up blood sugar regardless of your diet, and most wellness supplements don't address it.</p><p><strong>Avonent does.</strong> By pairing <strong>True Ceylon Cinnamon</strong> (featuring MHCP to mimic insulin at the cellular level) with <strong>Berberine HCl</strong> (one of nature’s strongest metabolic regulation compounds), Avonent targets insulin sensitivity from two distinct pathways. Suspended in <strong>pure MCT oil for maximum absorption</strong>, this high-potency formula maximizes bioavailability to unlock your cells, restore healthy insulin response, and keep your blood sugar balanced.</p>",
            "highlight": "An intentional addition to your metabolic wellness routine",
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/08DE2EEB-0E8F-4A11-BD96-9C53476780D4.png",
            "image_alt": "Avonent Ceylon cinnamon ingredient photograph",
            "image_caption": ""
          }
        },
        "reason_2": {
          "type": "benefit",
          "settings": {
            "category": "BLOOD SUGAR STABILIZATION",
            "heading": "Support Consistent Blood Sugar Levels All Day",
            "body": "<p>Most supplements only slow down how fast carbs hit your system. They don’t fix why your blood sugar keeps rising and falling throughout the day, so you stay on the rollercoaster.</p><p>Avonent uses genuine Ceylon cinnamon to help keep blood sugar steadier from morning to night. Instead of temporary blocks, it supports more consistent levels so you’re not dealing with the constant spikes and drops.</p>",
            "highlight": "Know the cinnamon variety—not just the marketing",
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/93ECE910-6549-45F6-95E6-F6266604EC60.png",
            "image_alt": "Avonent Ceylon cinnamon ingredient photograph",
            "image_caption": ""
          }
        },
        "reason_3": {
          "type": "benefit",
          "settings": {
            "category": "ENERGY RESTORATION",
            "heading": "Get Rid of Afternoon Crashes and Brain Fog",
            "body": "<p>When your cells are insulin resistant, glucose can’t enter properly. That leaves you exhausted, foggy, and craving sugar even when your blood sugar is already high.</p><p>Avonent’s Ceylon cinnamon helps restore cellular function so glucose can actually fuel your cells instead of sitting in your bloodstream. The result is steadier energy all day without the crashes or constant carb cravings.</p>",
            "highlight": "Build consistency instead of chasing another quick fix",
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/1B65CAC8-D1EC-4A92-A1D6-238AC0662275.png",
            "image_alt": "Avonent Ceylon cinnamon ingredient photograph",
            "image_caption": ""
          }
        },
        "reason_4": {
          "type": "benefit",
          "settings": {
            "category": "NO SIDE EFFECTS",
            "heading": "Escape the Side Effects That Won’t Stop",
            "body": "<p>Those digestive issues aren’t just bad luck. The blood sugar pills many people take disrupt the gut lining and deplete B12. That damage makes the nausea, cramping, and fatigue worse, trapping you in a cycle.</p><p>Avonent combines genuine Ceylon cinnamon with berberine to support cellular balance and healthy glucose metabolism naturally. It helps with both blood sugar and energy without the bloating, cramps, or constant bathroom runs that come with other options.</p>",
            "highlight": "",
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/350E3E49-E639-4A7F-B745-1FB5C17B47D8.png",
            "image_alt": "Avonent Ceylon cinnamon ingredient photograph",
            "image_caption": ""
          }
        },
        "reason_5": {
          "type": "benefit",
          "settings": {
            "category": "GENUINE CEYLON",
            "heading": "Not the “Cheap Cassia” Found in Grocery Stores",
            "body": "<p>Most cinnamon supplements use cheap Cassia. It contains up to 250 times more coumarin, a compound linked to liver stress with daily use. Many are also unverified and low quality.</p><p>Avonent uses 100% authentic Ceylon cinnamon from Sri Lanka. It naturally contains far less coumarin and is third-party tested so you can take it every day without the risk. That’s why it actually supports healthy blood sugar instead of just tasting like cinnamon.</p>",
            "highlight": "True Ceylon cinnamon—not an unspecified variety",
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/99A8FC23-1F52-4CC7-A154-36FC53C085C0.png",
            "image_alt": "Avonent Ceylon cinnamon ingredient photograph",
            "image_caption": ""
          }
        },
        "reason_6": {
          "type": "benefit",
          "settings": {
            "category": "CLINICALLY-VALIDATED",
            "heading": "More Than Promises. Backed by Research.",
            "body": "<p>Ceylon cinnamon and berberine have been studied in dozens of clinical trials for blood sugar support. Berberine alone has been tested in 46 randomized trials. Cinnamon has been examined in 45 studies. Research shows they can help restore insulin sensitivity and support healthy glucose levels without the side effects of prescription medications.</p><p>Avonent puts the full formula right on the label: 1,200 mg genuine Ceylon cinnamon, 400 mg berberine HCl, and 200 mg MCT oil per serving. No proprietary blends. No hiding the doses. You see exactly what you’re getting before you buy.</p>",
            "highlight": "Three named ingredients with clear quantities",
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/74C6DB7C-DF49-485B-9261-8297DF7A985E.png",
            "image_alt": "Avonent Ceylon cinnamon ingredient photograph",
            "image_caption": ""
          }
        },
        "reason_7": {
          "type": "benefit",
          "settings": {
