            "body": "<p>Over 100,000 customers have chosen Avonent, with more than 10,000 five-star reviews on the Ceylon cinnamon formula. People want clear ingredients they can actually understand, not another mystery blend.</p><p>Avonent pairs true Ceylon cinnamon with berberine HCl and MCT oil so you can support healthy blood sugar naturally without harsh medications or giving up the foods you enjoy.</p>",
